{"id": "sf-cathedral-impact-fee-missed-at-issuance", "title": "San Francisco issued a cathedral permit before collecting its $49,712 impact fee", "seconds": 55.4, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "f6084f244fc72a10", "words": 165, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco issued the building permit for Annunciation Cathedral on October 17, 2013.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.8, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$49,712", "label": "Neighborhood infrastructure fee"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.84, 1.15, 1.25, 1.62, 1.98, 2.14, 2.76, 3.55, 3.76, 4.21, 4.83, 5.12]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Planning later acknowledged that the City had missed a $49,712 neighborhood infrastructure fee due at issuance.", "t0": 5.92, "t1": 12.34, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Planning later acknowledged that the City had missed a $49,712 neighborhood infrastructure fee due at issuance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.6, 1.05, 1.17, 1.28, 1.56, 1.67, 1.93, 2.03, 2.57, 3.01, 3.32, 3.6, 3.93, 4.26, 4.67, 5.28, 5.52, 5.71, 5.84]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "In late 2021, the owner sought occupancy certificates.", "t0": 12.46, "t1": 15.84, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "memo", "kicker": "Planning memorandum", "text": "occupancy certificates", "mark": "occupancy"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.39, 0.67, 1.33, 1.5, 1.82, 2.11, 2.65]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "Building inspectors flagged the unpaid fee.", "t0": 15.96, "t1": 17.92, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Building inspectors flagged the unpaid fee"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.84, 1.17, 1.29, 1.66]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "The City issued a final fee report on December 5, 2022, and the owner appealed.", "t0": 18.04, "t1": 22.52, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The City issued a final fee report on December 5, 2022, and the owner appealed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.38, 0.68, 0.77, 1.08, 1.25, 1.64, 1.76, 2.14, 2.44, 2.7, 3.51, 3.68, 3.8, 4.03]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The owner argued that the cathedral replaced an earlier building.", "t0": 22.74, "t1": 25.8, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "memo", "kicker": "Planning memorandum", "text": "Charitable Exemption", "mark": "Exemption"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.49, 0.86, 1.01, 1.12, 1.63, 2.12, 2.25, 2.6]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "A charitable exemption covered a separate transit fee.", "t0": 25.92, "t1": 28.26, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "record", "context": "Planning review", "heading": "Two fee provisions", "layout": "relationship", "source": "memo", "rows": [{"icon": "transit", "label": "Transit fee", "value": "Charitable exemption"}, {"icon": "building", "label": "Neighborhood infrastructure", "value": "Assessed"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.58, 1.08, 1.36, 1.43, 1.72, 2.09]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "Planning found no corresponding exemption for the neighborhood infrastructure fee.", "t0": 28.38, "t1": 31.79, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Planning found no corresponding exemption for the neighborhood infrastructure fee"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.61, 0.78, 1.37, 1.83, 1.96, 2.06, 2.48, 3.12]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "On February 14, 2023, all 11 supervisors voted to uphold the assessment.", "t0": 31.91, "t1": 36.98, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "11", "label": "Supervisors upheld the fee"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.56, 1.14, 1.42, 2.36, 2.63, 2.96, 3.62, 3.98, 4.11, 4.38, 4.49]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "Planning told them the City had kept the 2013 amount without indexing or interest.", "t0": 37.1, "t1": 41.82, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Planning told them the City had kept the 2013 amount without indexing or interest"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.58, 0.82, 0.95, 1.28, 1.4, 1.61, 1.72, 2.03, 2.43, 3.1, 3.51, 4.05, 4.19]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "The public payer table runs through June 2025.", "t0": 42.04, "t1": 44.52, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fees", "kicker": "Public payer table through June 2025", "text": "Fee Amount Collected", "mark": "Collected"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.38, 0.64, 0.9, 1.1, 1.32, 1.54, 1.77]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "It lists neither project address nor the $49,712.", "t0": 44.64, "t1": 48.78, "shot": "fee-table", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$49,712", "label": "Assessment upheld"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.41, 0.72, 1.14, 1.57, 1.75, 1.87, 2.34, 2.77, 3.05, 3.3, 3.59]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "A project receipt or adjustment would establish what happened after the vote.", "t0": 48.9, "t1": 52.19, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A project receipt or adjustment would establish what happened after the vote"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.55, 0.92, 1.03, 1.55, 1.71, 2.17, 2.33, 2.67, 2.89, 3.0]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 52.31, "t1": 54.46, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The fee at issuance", "b": "The occupancy check", "o": "The appeal and the receipt"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "document"}